<title>SWITZERLAND: Basle Feb consumer inflation rises 0.2 pct vs Jan.</title>
<headline>Basle Feb consumer inflation rises 0.2 pct vs Jan.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in the city-canton of Basle rose 0.2 percent in February from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.9 percent, the Canton of Basle City Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				    Feb 1997   Jan 1997   Feb 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   +0.2 pct   +0.3 pct   +0.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.9 pct   +1.0 pct   +1.0 pct</p>
<p>   Index (May 1993 = 100)   104.5	104.3	103.6</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
